and also wishing strategy much harder.  What if fixing (making it
fooproof) a weapon made it also enchantment resistant.  There are two
(maybe more) problems to discuss:

- Should disenchanters ignore it?  (I think yes, as they are still an
important threat in the Hell)?

- Should we introduce a way to un-fix the stuff or should we make gods
grant non-fixed gifts?

I am sorry I can't write a patch for it, but think it's a good idea
making the game harder.

And what if we also could fix the beatitude?  This would make the
two-handed stuff more useful in Gehenna...

